{"slug":"Make-a-Server!-MA*-72770","_id":"6933416e948ab6f2c08b669d","title":"MAS-ex","game":{"_id":"68160c4675264eeaab7ac2b9","gameId":17341382599,"name":"Make a Server!","imageUrl":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/no-game.webp","original":null},"thumbnail":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/no-game.webp","original":null},"placeId":17341382599},"features":"Instead of disliking tell me what is wrong in the comments, I can improve the script. I usually check it once every day so try check your comment daily to see if I have responed. If you find the script kool then please leave a like and supportive comment! It really helps development! Ty :D\n\n[ + ] Added Feature [ - ] Removed Feature [ N ] Notes\n\n---- TYPE IN COMMENTS ANY SUGGESTIONS OR BUGS ----\n\nCHANGE LOGS [1.2.0] [Ultrasave Beta UPD]\n[ + ] Added MAS Defender\n[ + ] Added easy crash\n[ + ] New tab Player that will be updated soon\n[ - ] Removed some bugs\n[ N ] The save system will come out on V1.2.0\n\nPLANNED UPDATES [26/12/2025] [Version 1.2.1]\n[ N ] New features: \"Save selected builds\", \"Port to MAS\" and better error management\n[ N ] Preparing for 1.3.0\n[ N ] Also will include NO MORE OPEN SOURCE CODE!!!\n\nPLANNED UPDATES [1.3.0] [UI Overhaul]\n[ N ] New and fresh UI that fits with MAS's theme\n[ N ] Documentation on tools and features within MAS\n[ N ] Hopefully: Customization of MAS's UI allowing for your own custom themes and fonts\n[ N ] NOTE: this will be a free to use UI library, I am currently working on it. (it will be posted as a seperate script)\n[ N ] As of 24/12/2025 V1.3.0+ has fully comfirmed updates, nothing will be removed on first release, ty!\n\n---- FEATURES ----\n- Copy server code\n- Class ID Moving Up/Down\n- View server code\n- Code Block ESP and Links\n- SUPER QUICK autotool creation (both multitool and single tool)\n- Other scripts (if u want it)\n- Shows the updates on the MAS Update menu","tags":["make a server","development","sadrt","keyless","make"],"script":"